# `just readme` builds README.mepml's exports into build/ and copies only
# README.org back out (the file GitHub renders; it would show a README.md
# in its place). The .md and .html stay in build/, but a stray copy of
# either beside the source is not to be committed.
README.html
README.md
.scratch/

